# The *.wasm rule above also covers vendor/: desk embeds its own built demo
# (docs/*.wasm, ~7MB) so that `desk serve` needs nothing to host, and no build
# here reads it. `go mod vendor` writes it, git keeps it out, and the embed is
# a whole directory — so a fresh clone builds with the rest of docs/ and
# without the two binaries.
